AudioEngine landed: 264 tests across 20 files, 14 new for audio scheduling. The app unlocks on the first pointerdown, loads all seven samples into AudioBuffers, plays tap on every accepted tap, bonks when the motor reports one, and rides setEngine on the motor's speed through VehicleSystem.engineRate. Browser check: all seven mp3s fetched, every decode clean, no console messages; audibility is by ear. Deviation: no engine-loop sample exists in either vendored pack, so the engine is a synthesized sawtooth whose frequency is ENGINE_BASE_HZ (55) times the rate rather than a sampled loop driven by playbackRate.
